OL,3,GNEWSAFree Halloween family fun in Hull
OL,4,Afor half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull is hosting a series of family fun
OL,7,Fevents in the run-up to Halloween.
OL,9,FThe city will see magic shows, a
OL,10,Fwitches and pumpkin trail and a "Spooky
OL,11,FTransport" day, over the half-term
OL,12,Fholidays.
OL,14,FMost events are free, although booking
OL,15,Fmay be required for some.
OL,17,FMore information can be found on the
OL,18,Findividual events' websites.
